    "description": "Excellaa Florence is a residential development located in Pune's Pirangut. Excellaa Florence has apartments available. One and two-bedroom configurations are available.  The property is still being built. Four buildings are up for grabs. The project began in November 2021, and Excellaa Florence is expected to take possession in May 2028. Gat No 148/1,149,150,151 & 254 Opp, Bank Of India, Near Lavale, Phata, Pirangut is the address where Excellaa Florence can be found. Excellaa is the project developer. 882 units are up for grabs.\r\nExcellaa Florence offers a range of resident-focused amenities, such as a gym and power backup. In addition to the swimming pool, a children's play area is close by for families with young children. A basketball court is one option available to those who enjoy sports. The project's Barbecue Area is available to residents. Constant security is in place. It's a community with gates. At Excellaa Florence, live a lifestyle apart from the rest. This project complies with all state authority mandates. Excellaa Florence's RERA IDs are P52100030760, and P52100030786.",
    "builderDescription": "Kalyanee Fortune Group’s journey began 25 years ago with presence in textiles, diamonds, engineering and contracting sectors. Armed with little more than a desire to build a brand that would be respected for its excellence, the company ventured into the crowded real estate world as Kalyanee Fortune Properties (KFP) to make a mark. Headquartered in Mumbai & Pune, KFP is a merger of Kalyanee Construction and Fortune Properties. Realizing that the greatest demand for housing came from the very segment that could barely afford it: the middle-class, Kalyanee Fortune Properties now Excellaa set out to build a business that would design and construct homes that didn’t just fit middle-class pockets but also raised their living experiences to new levels of delight.",
