    "builderDescription": "With more than 25 years of experience in real-estate, we at Pragati Group sincerely believe that it takes more than brick and concrete to build a happy home. Transparency is the cornerstone of our business, while honouring commitments is a proud tradition. Our work is inspired by the idea of creating right-priced homes that give best value for money. Inspired by the timeless values of quality, integrity and commitment, Pragati Group has created a tangible footprint in Pune's construction business. Our mandate is simple: to create delightful living spaces where customers will find warmth and comfort, security and tranquility. With a portfolio of landmark projects at handpicked locations, we have emerged as a premier housing company that stands out by its thrust on building sustainable, eco-friendly projects. Driven by a core team of experienced, competent professionals, Pragati Group offers best value for money in each project through a fine synergy of style and substance",
